==English==
{{wikipedia|The Gambia}}
[[Image:Gambia w2 locator.svg|thumb|right|Gambia on a globe.]]

===Etymology===
From the name of the {{w|Gambia River}}. {{etystub|en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɡæm.bi.ə/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-Gambia.ogg|a=US}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=Gambia|head2=the Gambia}}

# {{place|en|river|r/West Africa}}.
# {{senseid|en|Q1005}}{{place|en|country|r/West Africa|official=Republic of The Gambia}}.

====Usage notes====
The country is referred to with the definite article {{m|en|the}}. The capitalization of the article when it occurs not at the beginning of a sentence varies.

